<h2 style="background-color:whitesmoke">India is one of the largest producers of agricultural products having diverse agro-climate zones across the country with vast range of agricultural products.
 The reprehensible storage results in high losses in grains, 30% of fruits and vegetables grown. During storage, quantitative as well as qualitative losses occur due to insects, rodents, and micro- organisms.
 To address the issues of the above concern and maintain proper stock details off all type of qualitative and qualitative loss products including their costs, we propose Cold Storage Management System (CSMS) for cold storage.
 Hence the product availability in cold storage with all necessary details of product are available here</h2>